Description: Functions for processing and analyzing survey data from the All of 
    Us Social Determinants of Health (AOUSDOH) program, including tools for 
    calculating health and well-being scores, recoding variables, and simplifying 
    survey data analysis. For more details see - Koleck TA, Dreisbach C, Zhang C, 
    Grayson S, Lor M, Deng Z, Conway A, Higgins PDR, Bakken S (2024) 
    <doi:10.1093/jamia/ocae214>.
